> Module Section7703
> Using Definitions as W

```catala-metadata
declaration scope MaritalStatusA:
  input world content W.World
  input taxpayer content W.Entity
  input period content W.TaxPeriod
  output result content W.MaritalResult

declaration scope TreatedAsUnmarried:
  input world content W.World
  input taxpayer content W.Entity
  input period content W.TaxPeriod
  input deductible_children content list of W.Entity
  output holds content boolean
```

§7703. Determination of marital status

(a) General rule

    (1) the determination of whether an individual is married shall be made as of the close of his taxable year; except that if his spouse dies during his taxable year such determination shall be made as of the time of such death; and


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section7703:b0003; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section7703(a)(1); source-lines: 5-5; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
scope MaritalStatusA:
  definition result equals
    let marriages equals
      list of event among (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Marriage)
      such that W.has_agent of event, taxpayer
                and W.overlaps_period of event.starts, event.ends, period in
    let separated equals legally_separated of world, taxpayer, period in
    let spouses equals
      combine all event among marriages
      in people initially []
      with people ++
        (list of person among event.agents
         such that not (W.same_entity of person, taxpayer)) in
    let active_spouses equals
      list of spouse among spouses such that
        not (exists death among (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Death)
             such that W.has_agent of death, spouse
               and exists died among death.starts
                   such that died <= period.last_day) in
    W.MaritalResult {
      -- married: active_spouses != [] and not separated
      -- spouses: spouses }
```

    (2) an individual legally separated from his spouse under a decree of divorce or of separate maintenance shall not be considered as married.


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section7703:b0004; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section7703(a)(2); source-lines: 7-7; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration legally_separated content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals
    let marriages equals
      list of marriage among (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Marriage)
      such that W.has_agent of marriage, taxpayer
                and W.overlaps_period of marriage.starts, marriage.ends, period in
    exists event among (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.LegalSeparation)
    such that W.overlaps_period of event.starts, event.ends, period
              and (W.has_agent of event, taxpayer
                   or exists marriage among marriages such that
                        W.has_patient of event, marriage.identifier)
```

(b) Certain married individuals living apart

For purposes of those provisions of this title which refer to this subsection, if-


```catala
declaration subsection_b_conditions content boolean
  depends on maintains_child_household content boolean,
             furnishes_household_majority content boolean,
             spouse_absent content boolean
  equals maintains_child_household
         and furnishes_household_majority
         and spouse_absent
```

    (1) an individual who is married (within the meaning of subsection (a)) and who files a separate return maintains as his home a household which constitutes for more than one-half of the taxable year the principal place of abode of a child with respect to whom such individual is entitled to a deduction for the taxable year under section 151,


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section7703:b0006; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section7703(b)(1); source-lines: 13-13; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
scope TreatedAsUnmarried:
  definition holds equals
    let marital equals
      (output of MaritalStatusA with {
        -- world: world -- taxpayer: taxpayer -- period: period }).result in
    marital.married
    and (not_considered_married of
           (maintains_home_for_child of world, taxpayer,
                                          deductible_children, period),
           (furnishes_over_half_household_cost of world, taxpayer, period),
           (spouse_absent_from_household of world, marital.spouses, period))

declaration maintains_home_for_child content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             deductible_children content list of W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals
    exists child among deductible_children such that
      exists residence among (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Residence)
      such that W.has_agent of residence, taxpayer
                and W.has_patient of residence, child
                and W.overlaps_period of residence.starts, residence.ends, period
```

    (2) such individual furnishes over one-half of the cost of maintaining such household during the taxable year, and


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section7703:b0007; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section7703(b)(2); source-lines: 15-15; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration furnishes_over_half_household_cost content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals
    let household_payments equals
      list of payment among (W.financial_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Payment)
      such that W.overlaps_period of payment.starts, payment.ends, period in
    let total_cost equals
      Money.sum of
        (combine all payment among household_payments
         in amounts initially []
         with amounts ++ (W.weighted_amounts of payment)) in
    let taxpayer_cost equals
      Money.sum of
        (combine all payment among household_payments
         in amounts initially []
         with if W.has_agent of payment, taxpayer
              then amounts ++ (W.weighted_amounts of payment)
              else amounts) in
    total_cost > $0 and taxpayer_cost > 50% * total_cost
```

    (3) during the last 6 months of the taxable year, such individual's spouse is not a member of such household,


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section7703:b0008; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section7703(b)(3); source-lines: 17-17; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration spouse_absent_from_household content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             spouses content list of W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals
    not (exists spouse among spouses such that
      exists residence among (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Residence)
      such that W.has_agent of residence, spouse
                and W.overlaps_period of residence.starts, residence.ends, period)
```

such individual shall not be considered as married.

```catala
declaration not_considered_married content boolean
  depends on maintains_child_household content boolean,
             furnishes_household_majority content boolean,
             spouse_absent content boolean
  equals subsection_b_conditions of maintains_child_household,
                                  furnishes_household_majority,
                                  spouse_absent
```
